  "notes": "A common word for fainting or losing consciousness. Used in both everyday conversation and dramatic contexts (novels, manga, etc.).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {気絶|きぜつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to faint, to pass out\n- {気絶|きぜつ}しそう⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧: to nearly faint\n- {気絶|きぜつ}⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧⟦{覚|さ}める→覚める：02058_sameru⟧: to regain consciousness\n- ⟦{一瞬|いっしゅん}→一瞬：01805_isshun⟧{気絶|きぜつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to black out for a moment\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{失神|しっしん}→失神：20933_shisshin⟧: fainting — more medical/formal\n- ⟦{意識|いしき}→意識：01714_ishiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{失|うしな}う→失う：01887_ushinau⟧: to lose consciousness — clinical description\n- ⟦{卒倒|そっとう}→卒倒：23022_sottou⟧: collapsing — emphasizes the physical falling",
